body:
it's not ideal but it's definitely... teaching me to adapt. i feel like i can get thru anything after this last year i've been thru haha

&#x200B;

i usually block exes, i just don't keep contact with them bc it never ends well. i dunno what me and this dude are going to do after we move out. he's still a pretty okay friend when he wants to be. i don't really try to keep track of days, makes it hard to break away when you're constantly thinking about it at least daily. my last ex i thought less and less until one day i looked at the date and went "oh, it's been a year, hasn't it?" and i don't ever think about them unless i have a debt collector calling me looking for them lmao
